      25/   0 :                         ; 6551 control register: bit 4 = 1 -> internal baud generator, 8 data
      26/   0 :                         ; bits, 1 stop bit.  With a 1.8432 MHz crystal: 1EH = 9600, 1FH = 19200.
      27/   0 :                         ; The KB/display card uses 10H = 115200 N-8-1 (value from the 6502 system).
      28/   0 :                         ; The serial card is set to 9600 here; change SERBAUD to taste.
      29/   0 : =1EH                    SERBAUD     EQU 1EH
