     331/ 224 : 3E 00                           MVI  A,0
     332/ 226 : C8                              RZ
     333/ 227 : 3D                              DCR  A                  ; FFH
     334/ 228 : C9                              RET
     335/ 229 :                         
     336/ 229 :                         ; Polled transmit, preserves all registers. Disables interrupts around the
     337/ 229 :                         ; status read, drains any received byte it finds, and re-enables interrupts
     338/ 229 :                         ; on exit (don't call with interrupts intentionally off).
